     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The body and pain",
     "texto": [
      "**Baş** = head; **karın** = stomach; **boğaz** = throat; **diş** = tooth.",
      "**Başım ağrıyor** = my head hurts (literally, my head is hurting). The suffix **-ım** means «my».",
      "**Hastayım** = I'm ill; **iyiyim** = I'm fine. **Doktor** is doctor and **eczane** is pharmacy."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
